WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Here is a quick look at a Python calculator.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I type twelve and choose addition.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Next, I enter thirty as the second value.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The calculator adds them and displays forty-two.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The result is forty-two.
